Subject: [PATCH] mc: casters hold while an add carries magic reflection

WHY THIS PATCH EXISTS

Majordomo Executus casts Magic Reflection (20619) on himself and his adds
every 30 seconds. The `moltencore` strategy excludes Majordomo himself from
damage (AppendTargetExclusions, MCStrategy.cpp at the pinned SHA) but never
reads the reflection aura, so casters keep casting into it and are hit by
their own spells.

While an add carries Magic Reflection, casters hold their spells on it and
switch to an unshielded target, or wand or wait. A new
MajordomoReflectionMultiplier returns 0 for spell casts on a reflection
shielded add, and logs `[MC] majordomo: N casters holding, magic reflection
on <add>`.

WHAT WOULD LET THIS PATCH BE DELETED

Upstream adds a reflect-aware target check to the Molten Core combat
strategy or the generic caster targeting, at which point this multiplier is
redundant.

